      },
      {
        "text": "A wall recording at Immortal Crane Sect shows that after Bai Ning Bing’s self-detonation suppressed him, Lord Sky Crane was forced to use the Life-burial Jade Gu, broke out of the ice, and found only Fang Zheng under it. Reporting to He Feng Yang, he says his lifespan is at its limit with only a few days left, and even the life-burial jade gu cannot change his fate.",
        "chapters": [
          211
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
