  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When almost dying, Lord Sky Crane uses the life-retaining Jade Burial Gu, living through death and sealing himself. With Immortal Crane Sect help he uses the life-preserving Jade Burial Gu, falling into a deep sleep and preserving his last bit of life. That method and First gen Gu Yue’s zombie turn are both unorthodox desperate measures; life-preserving life burial hangs onto life but does not increase lifespan.",
        "chapters": [
          192
        ],
